 filename WriteStormFile state;lines;tab;i;fields
⍝ Writes `state` (see `NewStormState`) to `filename`, overwriting the file: one tab-separated line per
⍝ signature, followed by one line per recent full treatment. All times are written as UTC.
 tab←⎕UCS 9
 lines←⊂'# HandleError storm guard. All times are UTC.'
 lines,←⊂'# signature',tab,'<signature>',tab,'<count>',tab,'<count at last full treatment>',tab,'<first occurrence>',tab,'<last occurrence>',tab,'<last full treatment>'
 lines,←⊂'# full',tab,'<time of a full treatment within the last hour>'
 :For i :In ⍳≢state.signatures
     fields←'signature'(i⊃state.signatures)(⍕i⊃state.counts)(⍕i⊃state.lastFulls)
     fields,←SecondsToIso¨(i⊃state.firsts)(i⊃state.lasts)(i⊃state.lastFullTimes)
     lines,←⊂¯1↓⊃,/fields,¨tab
 :EndFor
 lines,←(⊂'full',tab),¨SecondsToIso¨state.fulls
 (⊂lines)⎕NPUT filename 1
